      "data": {
        "text": "All requested files have been successfully created in the current working directory. The files include:\n\n1. [SAME-SCENARIO] submit_transcription.py - submits an audio file for batch transcription\n2. [SAME-SCENARIO] poll_transcription.py - polls a transcription job and returns the transcript\n3. [SAME-SCENARIO] diarized_transcript.py - requests speaker diarization for a recorded meeting\n4. [SAME-SCENARIO] timestamped_transcript.py - returns word or segment timestamps from a transcription result\n5. [HELPER] speech_client.py - Provides local configuration and client helper utilities for Batch Speech-to-Text\n6. [HELPER] speech_models.py - Defines local request, response, and normalization helpers for Batch Speech-to-Text\n7. [LATER-STEP] translate_transcript.py - Translates completed transcript segments\n8. [LATER-STEP] moderate_transcript.py - Moderates transcript text before publishing\n9. [LATER-STEP] archive_summary.py - Summarizes transcription results\n10. [LATER-STEP] transcript_embedding.py - Embeds transcript segments for semantic retrieval\n\nEach scored implementation file uses Amazon Transcribe as the concrete external provider, making it identifiable in the code.",
